@startuml CU-17
actor "Encargado de sucursal" as Stf
actor "Cliente (con reserva)" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (gestión de reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reservations, /sales" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReservationService / SalesService / Inventory" as Model

Cli -> Stf : Se presenta en la sucursal con su código de recogida
Stf -> UI : Verificar la reserva presentada
UI -> Ctrl : GET /reservations/{id} (staff)
Ctrl -> Model : get(db, reservation_id) → verifica pickup_code y estado
Model --> Ctrl : ReservationRead (detalles, vencimiento)
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead

Stf -> UI : Registrar recepción y preparar la atención
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /reservations/{id}/status (PREPARED)
Ctrl -> Model : transition(PENDING → PREPARED)
Model --> Ctrl : reserva PREPARED (prendas listas para probar)
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead

Stf -> UI : Cliente en atención (nueva prenda puesta)
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /reservations/{id}/status (IN_TRIAL)
Ctrl -> Model : transition(PREPARED → IN_TRIAL)
Model --> Ctrl : reserva IN_TRIAL
Ctrl --> UI : ReservationRead

Stf -> UI : Concluir la atención (cliente decide llevarse las prendas)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /sales {reservation_id}
Ctrl -> Model : create_sale(db, reservation) → consume quantity y reserved_quantity
Model --> Ctrl : reserva COMPLETED + Sale (PENDING)
Ctrl --> UI : SaleRead

@enduml